C03: absolute brightness level reader and reviewed system.settings.set (BRIGHT1287)

effect_intent: _literal_brightness_level («poné el brillo al 80», «al 80%», «al máximo», «set the brightness to 40») → system.settings.set; __main__ grounds {setting: brightness, value}. App: ExecuteReviewedAsync admits system.settings.set so the root can approve the sensitive set for the requested value.

